WEBVTT

01:29.470 --> 01:32.940
[Cage of Shadows]

01:33.680 --> 01:36.200
[Episode 18]

01:39.039 --> 01:40.160
Yanzhi.

01:44.300 --> 01:45.500
Nan Yanzhi.

01:47.600 --> 01:49.000
Open your eyes.

03:28.270 --> 03:29.390
Mother.

03:29.710 --> 03:31.710
I finally got the antidote.

03:31.910 --> 03:33.240
Wait for me.

04:27.010 --> 04:27.970
Yanzhi,

04:28.170 --> 04:30.300
don't blame me for being too ruthless.

04:30.330 --> 04:31.630
If it weren't for this,

04:31.980 --> 04:33.840
how could we have fooled Meng Shuo

04:33.880 --> 04:35.480
and the entire Lingya Tower?

05:04.310 --> 05:05.940
[Virtue and Merit in Equal Splendor]

05:08.100 --> 05:09.220
Mother.

05:15.720 --> 05:16.840
Mother.

05:24.120 --> 05:25.720
Mother!

05:32.340 --> 05:33.540
Mother?

05:34.090 --> 05:35.159
Mother.

05:43.640 --> 05:44.600
Mr. Wu,

05:45.120 --> 05:46.180
where is my mother?

06:08.750 --> 06:10.400
[Tomb of the Late Father, Nan Shiren]

06:10.420 --> 06:12.410
[Tomb of the Late Mother, Madam Yang]

06:27.280 --> 06:28.320
Please.

06:31.330 --> 06:32.840
[Auspice from the East]

06:32.000 --> 06:32.930
Uncle, I'm sorry

06:33.360 --> 06:34.880
for keeping you waiting.

06:34.880 --> 06:35.930
Not at all.

06:36.159 --> 06:37.890
You came at just the right time.

06:38.280 --> 06:39.409
Please, have a seat.

06:41.159 --> 06:41.920
Go ask

06:42.000 --> 06:43.659
why Jingjing hasn't come yet.

06:43.920 --> 06:44.600
Yes.

06:44.680 --> 06:45.720
My Lady,

06:45.920 --> 06:47.840
Mr. Liu has been waiting for a long time.

06:47.840 --> 06:49.500
You should at least go see him.

06:49.560 --> 06:51.440
Otherwise, snubbing him like this

06:51.440 --> 06:53.700
might bring shame to the Prime Minister.

06:57.360 --> 06:59.560
Given my current looks, I don't believe

07:00.290 --> 07:02.620
anyone would truly be willing to marry me.

07:03.880 --> 07:05.850
We still haven't found
the killer of Nian'an,

07:05.850 --> 07:07.080
and you want me to remarry.

07:07.080 --> 07:08.150
No way!

07:08.180 --> 07:09.150
Jingjing,

07:09.240 --> 07:11.000
I want Liu Yuan to marry into our family.

07:11.000 --> 07:13.000
He is also an imperial scholar.

07:13.280 --> 07:15.160
He is no worse than Shen Nian'an.

07:15.160 --> 07:17.040
Nian'an is the only one I love.

07:18.030 --> 07:20.290
I'll never love anyone else in this life.

07:21.140 --> 07:22.100
Jingjing,

07:22.520 --> 07:26.360
Liu Yuan and Shen Nian'an
were close friends.

07:27.080 --> 07:28.100
He has

07:28.290 --> 07:29.290
a good reputation

07:29.320 --> 07:31.460
-for both his talent and character.
-I've made up my mind!

07:31.460 --> 07:32.920
Don't push me any further!

07:33.640 --> 07:34.800
Matters of marriage

07:35.040 --> 07:36.280
are decided by parents

07:36.280 --> 07:37.540
and matchmakers' words!

07:37.540 --> 07:39.600
You are not allowed to act on your own!

07:40.720 --> 07:41.760
Is that so?

07:42.320 --> 07:43.640
If you insist, Father,

07:43.720 --> 07:45.580
I'll have no choice but to do this!

07:45.920 --> 07:46.840
Jingjing,

07:46.960 --> 07:49.590
I just want you to find a good husband.

07:49.610 --> 07:51.960
Why are you trying to kill yourself?

08:00.400 --> 08:01.200
Father,

08:02.570 --> 08:04.170
my face has been disfigured.

08:05.680 --> 08:07.940
Surely no one will be willing to marry me.

08:08.960 --> 08:10.200
As for my marriage,

08:11.960 --> 08:14.220
you don't need to worry about it anymore.

08:14.860 --> 08:15.750
My Lady,

08:16.200 --> 08:17.660
why did you have to do that?

08:17.660 --> 08:19.300
Even if you don't want to remarry,

08:19.300 --> 08:21.700
you didn't have to
ruin yourself like that.

08:22.680 --> 08:24.160
My Lady!

08:24.480 --> 08:25.760
Your husband is already gone,

08:25.760 --> 08:26.600
but life still has to go on.

08:26.600 --> 08:27.600
Isn't that right?

08:28.240 --> 08:30.200
If it weren't to avenge Nian'an,

08:30.520 --> 08:32.840
I'm afraid
I would have died with him long ago!

08:32.840 --> 08:34.299
But the Prime Minister...

08:34.470 --> 08:35.640
Help me tell them

08:35.799 --> 08:38.530
that it's inconvenient for me
to receive guests.

09:01.090 --> 09:03.300
Why didn't you just kill me back then?

09:03.760 --> 09:04.640
Why?

09:07.090 --> 09:09.450
Why?

09:28.390 --> 09:30.390
I don't have a mother anymore.

09:31.440 --> 09:34.040
I'll never see my mother again.

09:45.510 --> 09:46.490
Auntie,

09:46.520 --> 09:47.940
it's all my fault.

09:48.580 --> 09:49.710
If it weren't for me,

09:49.830 --> 09:51.890
they wouldn't have found this place.

09:52.040 --> 09:53.410
I implicated you.

09:53.480 --> 09:54.370
Wujiu.

09:55.560 --> 09:57.200
It's not your fault.

09:58.560 --> 10:02.080
If you truly want
to repay my family's kindness,

10:03.250 --> 10:04.410
please...

10:08.340 --> 10:10.910
take good care of Yanzhi.

10:14.500 --> 10:15.780
Mother!

10:30.150 --> 10:31.270
Does it still hurt?

10:32.840 --> 10:35.170
Compared to the torture you've suffered,

10:37.680 --> 10:39.640
my injuries are nothing.

10:41.040 --> 10:41.720
Master.

10:44.360 --> 10:45.320
From now on,

10:45.790 --> 10:47.750
you don't need to worry about me anymore.

10:47.750 --> 10:49.810
Don't shoulder it all by yourself anymore.

10:49.810 --> 10:51.860
I want to fight alongside you.

10:52.720 --> 10:53.240
For my parents

10:53.240 --> 10:54.120
and for you.

10:54.660 --> 10:56.520
Let's go make them pay what they owe

10:56.520 --> 10:57.280
together.

11:03.280 --> 11:04.240
Okay.

11:05.340 --> 11:06.540
We'll do it together.

11:54.440 --> 11:55.360
Master.

11:56.400 --> 11:58.160
So you knew Shen Nian'an.

11:59.120 --> 12:00.360
All those years,

12:00.620 --> 12:03.460
he had been investigating the mastermind
behind the Lingya Tower,

12:03.460 --> 12:04.580
Hei Ya.

12:03.790 --> 12:06.650
[Hei Ya will show up soon. Come quickly]

12:06.170 --> 12:08.230
Unfortunately, I was still too late.

12:08.360 --> 12:09.690
Before I could meet him,

12:10.120 --> 12:11.200
he was murdered.

12:11.560 --> 12:13.490
No wonder the killer was so brutal.

12:14.040 --> 12:15.280
So it was Hei Ya.

12:16.580 --> 12:18.090
So if we follow this lead,

12:18.240 --> 12:19.520
we can find Hei Ya, right?

12:19.520 --> 12:20.320
Yes.

12:21.040 --> 12:22.890
Later, through some investigations,

12:22.890 --> 12:23.950
I found some clues

12:24.160 --> 12:25.960
in Prime Minister Lin's Mansion.

12:25.960 --> 12:27.690
The Prime Minister's Mansion?

12:29.380 --> 12:30.180
Yanzhi,

12:30.590 --> 12:32.070
I need your help now.
